  "composer": {
    "accepted_prose": "Tomi drags her knuckles over her cheek, then exhales hard. \"Ten minutes. I'm not disappearing—I just want the quiet. If I need something after that, I'll say so, but right now I'm asking for the space.\"\n\nMia sets her palms lightly together, her voice low and tentative. \"If you decide you want something, I could get cold water and a plain rice ball. But I'm not bringing anything unless you ask. It's just an option.\"\n\nYuuni taps a single earbud against her thigh. \"There's a quiet instrumental playlist on my phone. If you ever want music, I can put it on low. I'm not starting it now, though.\"",
